  "description": "At some point, the way his nephew—whom he had always thought of as just a child—looked at him began to feel strange. After dreaming of Han’s hands caressing him with desire, Seok-in becomes sexually aware of his nephew for the first time. Yet, unwilling to lose the only family he has left, Seok-in pretends not to notice the way Han looks at him... \"Uncle, you brought this on yourself.\" And so, his relationship with his nephew began to go awry.\nSource: MU",
